OL,3,A'I've got a band now' - Club anthem
OL,4,Astar Shygirl on why she's switching up
OL,5,Aher sound
OL,6,
OL,7,FHard-hitting beats, club anthems and
OL,8,Funapologetically sexy lyrics are what
OL,9,FShygirl is known for.
OL,11,FBut the singer and DJ - real name Blane
OL,12,FMuise - has introduced a different
OL,13,Fsound for her second album, Swallow!,
OL,14,Fwhich dropped on Friday.
OL,16,FShygirl hasn't totally left her
OL,17,Felectronic roots behind though.
OL,19,FYou can still hear the sweat-soaked
OL,20,Fenergy of Charli XCX's 365 remix and
OL,21,Frelentless pulse of 2024 hit mr useless
OL,22,Fon her latest record.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
